    "tempted": {
      "operation": "replace",
      "lines": [
        {"zh": "蠕动着靠近你，根须触碰你的脚踝。", "en": "Slink closer, roots touch your ankle."},
        {"zh": "你的好奇心引诱了它，但它不信任。", "en": "Your curiosity lures it, but it's wary."},
        {"zh": "享受这一刻，你成为它的美食。", "en": "Enjoy this moment, you're its meal."},
        {"zh": "它用触手探索你的背包，寻找可食用之物。", "en": "It probes your backpack, seeking edible items."},
        {"zh": "它的触手在你周围游荡，寻找机会。", "en": "Its roots wander around you, seeking an opening."},
        {"zh": "它用根须轻拂你，试图诱导你。", "en": "It brushes you with roots, trying to lure you."},
        {"zh": "它的触手缠住你的脚，不让你动弹。", "en": "Its roots entangle your feet, preventing movement."},
        {"zh": "它享受着对你的控制，根须缠绕在你身上。", "en": "It enjoys control, roots wrapping around you."},
        {"zh": "你试图摆脱它，但根须紧紧缠住你。", "en": "You try to escape, but roots grip you tightly."},
